1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
A GPU sitting idle?
Put it to work — on your own terms

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Distributed GPU is a self-hosted control plane:
submit a job, it lands in a durable queue

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Placement is precise — matched on VRAM,
GPU model, capabilities, and model packs

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000
dworker inventories a machine's GPU
and advertises only the routes you select

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Pause new claims whenever you like, or gate
claiming on the machine being confirmed idle

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:35,000
An image-generate job runs on one NVIDIA
worker — a real local deployment

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
The validated PNG result
lands back in the workbench

8
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Controller GPL-3.0-or-later · Worker MIT
github.com/autonomica-xyz/distributed-gpu
